Z||000027||SCCA FIERO||05-17-2000||12:23 AM||||Here is my baby. It is an 88 Coupe with a 2.8V6, GT wheels, 1" rear swaybar, K&N filter, shortened shifter and a fastback conversion. <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/img016(1)_3.jpg">   <P>Here it is wearing racing shoes... kinda flashy, huh?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SCCA.jpg"> <P>[This message has been edited by SCCA FIERO (edited 05-17-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by SCCA FIERO (edited 05-17-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000028||Oreif||05-17-2000||10:33 AM||||The driving lights I have are "NightBlaster" projectors. They are 75W and I got them thru Trak Auto. I have also seen them at Pep Boys.<BR>I think they were $80.00 if I remember correctly. I have the relay that controls them wired to the parking lights. So they can only come on when the parking lights are on. I also have a switch inside so I can turn them off while all the other lights are on. (That way I won't accidently leave them on and drain the battery)<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 05-17-2000).]||||reg||1
